# =============================================================================
# Forensiwipe AI Forensic Engine — .gitignore
# Project: Project Forensiwipe (Air-Gapped Forensic Carving & Evidence Triage)
# Specification Reference: PRD.md (v4)
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Forensic Evidence & Raw Disk Images (CRITICAL - Evidentiary Integrity)
# PRD Sec 1 & Sec 2: Raw evidence must NEVER be committed to version control.
# Leaking evidence breaches chain of custody, privacy laws (DPDP/BSA), and exposes
# suspect/victim PII, confidential media, and raw disk blocks.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.raw
*.dd
*.img
*.bin
*.001
*.dmg
*.iso

# Expert Witness Format (EWF / EnCase) & Advanced Forensic Format (AFF)
*.E01
*.Ex01
*.e01
*.L01
*.aff
*.aff4

# Virtual Machine Disks & Container Images
*.vmdk
*.vdi
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.qcow2

# Memory & Crash Dumps
*.dmp
*.dump
*.mem
*.crash

# Temporary forensic test images & mmap probes (e.g. forensiwipe_mmap_probe.bin)
*mmap_probe*
*_test_image*
test_images/
fixtures/evidence/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Recovered / Carved Evidence Artifacts (Sensitive Case Material)
# PRD FR2.0 - FR2.3: Carved byte streams, reassembled files, extracted payloads.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
carved/
carved_output/
extracted/
recovered/
artifacts/
output/
exports/
*.carved
*.recovered

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. BSA 2023 Section 63 Digital Signatures, Keys & Certificates (Tamper Risk)
# PRD FR4.3: Legal admissibility certificates with dual-signature verification.
# Examiner & expert private keys/certificates must NEVER enter Git.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.key
*.pem
*.pkcs12
*.pfx
*.p12
*.priv
*.sig
*.signature
*.asc
*.crt
*.cert
*.cer
keys/
certs/
credentials/
secrets/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Forensic Triage Reports & Extracted PII / Financial Data (Privacy Risk)
# PRD FR3.4 (Aadhaar, PAN, card numbers) & FR4.2/FR4.5 (Evidence JSON/PDF reports).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
reports/
triage_reports/
triage_out/
report_*.pdf
evidence_*.json
triage_*.json
*.pdf
*.csv
*.xlsx

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Heavy AI/ML Model Weights, Checkpoints & GGUF LLMs (PRD Sec 2)
# The air-gapped system loads models locally from models/ (<=3B parameter GGUF).
# Large binaries (GGUF, PyTorch checkpoints, SafeTensors) must not bloat Git.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/*.gguf
models/*.bin
models/*.safetensors
models/*.pt
models/*.pth
models/*.ckpt
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.ckpt

# Locally generated/exported ONNX model weights (can be re-trained on synthetic corpus)
models/*.onnx
!models/.gitkeep

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Local Vector Database & Semantic Embeddings (ChromaDB / SQLite)
# PRD FR3.1: Air-gapped persistent vector store indexing evidence chunks.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
chroma/
chromadb/
.chroma/
vector_store/
*.sqlite3
*.db
!tests/*.db

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Offline Air-Gapped Dependency Wheelhouse
# requirements.txt: "pip download -r requirements.txt -d wheelhouse/"
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
wheelhouse/
*.whl

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. Explainability & Attribution Caches
# PRD FR1.5 (SHAP vectors) & FR2.4 (Captum Grad-CAM heatmaps).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
shap_cache/
explainability_out/
*.shap

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9. Python Runtime, Bytecode & Virtual Environments
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Virtual environments
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
env/
venv/
.venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# Testing & Coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 10. Tool Caches & Intermediate Workstation Files
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
graphify-out/cache/
.remember/tmp/
.remember/logs/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 11. OS & IDE Specific Files
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.lock
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
